    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roll, jump, and teleport your way through 10 challenging levels in this fast-paced physics platformer!</strong> Master precise movements as you navigate moving platforms, avoid deadly traps, and time your jumps perfectly. <br><br>Each level is designed to test your reflexes and creativity, with global leaderboards tracking your best completion times. Choose between Normal and Hard modes: in Hard mode, checkpoints are disabled for the ultimate challenge. Just you, gravity, and the clock.</p>",
